---
import MetaPage from "@/components/MetaPage.astro"
import Layout from "@/layouts/Layout.astro"
---

<Layout>
  <MetaPage slot="head" />
  <about-entry>
    <h1 class="typewriter">About</h1>
    <prose-content>
      <p>
        Hi, I'm Arsenic :3
      </p>

      <p>
        I've always been someone that's incredibly in love with the process of things. Whether it
        be humanities, STEM, or anything in between-- I enjoy a lot of them! 
      </p>

      <p>
        I went to pursue technology instead after wanting to be an animator during my formative years.
        I thought technology was the perfect bridge-- it has everything anyone can think of and it's broadcasted
        to about everyone with internet access. 
      </p>

      <p>
        After some contemplating on which route to take, I saw who used to be an acquaintance of mine (now
        close friend) messaged a Discord server that I was a part of in high school for Computer Science. He 
        was inviting people who are passionate in cybersecurity to join SWIFT. I decided to give cybersecurity
        a try, and truly enjoyed how deeply systematic and process heavy the field is. You can see my work in here!
      </p>

      <p>
        Despite my introduction being really more cybersecurity heavy-- I'm always open to talking and
        meeting new people :D feel free to hit me up! I'm always down to talk about anything hehe :3c 
      </p>

      <p>
        Also, thanks to these people that help me to where I am today:
      </p>

      <p>
      @bri5ee - my mentor :3 I learned a lot from him-- thank you for your patience, kindness, and help throughout &lt;3
      </p>

      <p>
      @dylan/dylan tran/nigel/nigerald/salsa guzzler/etc - actually changed my whole career trajectory :,D I wouldn't know where I'd be right now if he didn't send that text AND continue to do cyber for the love of the game :p
      </p>

      <p>
      I am inspired by these websites, check them out! :
      </p>
      <p>
        <a href="https://enscribe.dev" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferer">enscribe.dev</a>
      </p>
      <p>
        <a href="https://phao.dev/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferer">phao.dev</a>
      </p>
    </prose-content>
  </about-entry>
</Layout>

<style>
  about-entry {
    display: block;
    font-size: var(--step-0);
    color: var(--muted-foreground);

    @media (width >= 64rem) {
      margin-block-start: -0.2em;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: var(--step-6);
      line-height: calc(var(--leading-offset) + 1em);
      font-weight: var(--font-weight-medium);
      color: var(--foreground);
      margin-block-end: var(--space-2xs);

      &.typewriter {
        display: block;
        overflow: hidden;
        white-space: nowrap;
        border-right: 5px solid var(--primary);
        width: 4.4ch;
        animation:
          type 0.6s ease-out forwards,
          blink-caret 0.75s step-end infinite;
      }
    }

    prose-content {
      margin-block-start: var(--space-xs);
    }
  }

  @keyframes type {
    from { width: 0; }
    to   { width: 4.4ch; }
  }

  @keyframes blink-caret {
    50% { border-color: transparent; }
  }
</style>